{"seq":2,"slug":"quadtree-octree","title":"四叉树与八叉树：自适应空间细分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/quadtree-octree","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"四叉树与八叉树-自适应空间细分\">四叉树与八叉树：自适应空间细分</h1><p>空间哈希在对象均匀分布时表现优秀，但现实游戏场景往往高度不均匀——城市中心有数百个 NPC，偏远荒野只有几头野兽。均匀网格在稀疏区域浪费大量空间，在稠密区域又不够精细。<strong>四叉树（Quadtree）<strong>和</strong>八叉树（Octree）<strong>通过</strong>递归细分</strong>解决这个问题：只有当一个区域包含足够多的对象时，才进一步分割它，形成与对象密度自适应的层次结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>四叉树</strong>：2D 空间的递归四分，每个节点分裂为 NW/NE/SW/SE 四个象限</li>\n<li><strong>八叉树</strong>：3D 空间的递归八分，子节点用 3 位二进制编码索引（bit2=X，bit1=Y，bit0=Z 方向）</li>\n<li><strong>分裂阈值</strong>：节点对象数超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 时分裂（通常 4-16），防止深树通过最大深度（通常 6-10）限制</li>\n<li><strong>跨节点对象</strong>：放入最低公共祖先或使用松散变体；大对象积累在根节点会导致性能退化</li>\n<li><strong>节点合并</strong>：对象数低于阈值的一半时合并，避免频繁分裂-合并抖动</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"四叉树-2d-场景的自适应划分\">四叉树：2D 场景的自适应划分</h2><h3 id=\"基本结构\">基本结构</h3><p>四叉树将 2D 空间递归分割为四个象限（NW、NE、SW、SE）。每个节点存储一个轴对齐矩形区域，当区域内的对象数量超过阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 时，节点分裂为 4 个子节点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Root[根节点\\n整个世界 [0,100]x[0,100]\\n对象: A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H&quot;] --&gt; NW[西北象限\\n[0,50]x[50,100]\\n对象: A,B,C&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; NE[东北象限\\n[50,100]x[50,100]\\n对象: D&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; SW[西南象限\\n[0,50]x[0,50]\\n对象: E,F,G,H&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; SE[东南象限\\n[50,100]x[0,50]\\n(空节点)&quot;]&#10;    SW --&gt; SW_NW[&quot;细分 NW\\n对象: E,F&quot;]&#10;    SW --&gt; SW_NE[&quot;细分 NE\\n对象: G&quot;]&#10;    SW --&gt; SW_SW[&quot;细分 SW\\n对象: H&quot;]&#10;    SW --&gt; SW_SE[&quot;细分 SE\\n(空)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Root[根节点\\n整个世界 [0,100]x[0,100]\\n对象: A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H\"] --&gt; NW[西北象限\\n[0,50]x[50,100]\\n对象: A,B,C\"]\n    Root --&gt; NE[东北象限\\n[50,100]x[50,100]\\n对象: D\"]\n    Root --&gt; SW[西南象限\\n[0,50]x[0,50]\\n对象: E,F,G,H\"]\n    Root --&gt; SE[东南象限\\n[50,100]x[0,50]\\n(空节点)\"]\n    SW --&gt; SW_NW[\"细分 NW\\n对象: E,F\"]\n    SW --&gt; SW_NE[\"细分 NE\\n对象: G\"]\n    SW --&gt; SW_SW[\"细分 SW\\n对象: H\"]\n    SW --&gt; SW_SE[\"细分 SE\\n(空)\"]</pre><h3 id=\"节点实现\">节点实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct QuadtreeNode {&#10;    float minX, minY, maxX, maxY;  // 节点边界&#10;    std::vector&lt;int&gt; objects;       // 存储的对象 ID（叶节点）&#10;    QuadtreeNode* children[4];      // NW, NE, SW, SE（内部节点）&#10;    bool isLeaf;&#10;&#10;    static constexpr int MAX_OBJECTS = 8;   // 分裂阈值&#10;    static constexpr int MAX_DEPTH   = 10;  // 最大深度限制&#10;&#10;    void insert(int objId, float x, float y, int depth) {&#10;        if (isLeaf) {&#10;            objects.push_back(objId);&#10;            if (objects.size() &gt; MAX_OBJECTS &amp;&amp; depth &lt; MAX_DEPTH) {&#10;                split();&#10;            }&#10;        } else {&#10;            int quadrant = getQuadrant(x, y);&#10;            children[quadrant]-&gt;insert(objId, x, y, depth + 1);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QuadtreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minX, minY, maxX, maxY;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 节点边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;int></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> objects;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 存储的对象 ID（叶节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    QuadtreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> children[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // NW, NE, SW, SE（内部节点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isLeaf;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_OBJECTS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 分裂阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> constexpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_DEPTH   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 最大深度限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> objId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> depth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isLeaf) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            objects.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push_back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(objId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (objects.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_OBJECTS </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MAX_DEPTH) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quadrant </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getQuadrant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            children[quadrant]-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(objId, x, y, depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"八叉树-3d-空间的自然延伸\">八叉树：3D 空间的自然延伸</h2><p>八叉树将四叉树扩展到 3D，将空间递归分割为 8 个子空间。每个内部节点有 8 个子节点，对应三维坐标的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>±</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>±</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm x, \\pm y, \\pm z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 八个象限。</p>\n<h3 id=\"子节点索引编码\">子节点索引编码</h3><p>用 3 位二进制编码子节点索引，直观且高效：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>索引</th>\n<th>X 方向</th>\n<th>Y 方向</th>\n<th>Z 方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0 (000)</td>\n<td>负（西）</td>\n<td>负（下）</td>\n<td>负（南）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 (001)</td>\n<td>负</td>\n<td>负</td>\n<td>正（北）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 (010)</td>\n<td>负</td>\n<td>正（上）</td>\n<td>负</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 (011)</td>\n<td>负</td>\n<td>正</td>\n<td>正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 (100)</td>\n<td>正（东）</td>\n<td>负</td>\n<td>负</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 (101)</td>\n<td>正</td>\n<td>负</td>\n<td>正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6 (110)</td>\n<td>正</td>\n<td>正</td>\n<td>负</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7 (111)</td>\n<td>正</td>\n<td>正</td>\n<td>正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"int getOctant(float cx, float cy, float cz,&#10;              float px, float py, float pz) {&#10;    // cx,cy,cz 是节点中心，px,py,pz 是点坐标&#10;    return ((px &gt;= cx) ? 4 : 0) |&#10;           ((py &gt;= cy) ? 2 : 0) |&#10;           ((pz &gt;= cz) ? 1 : 0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getOctant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> cx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> cy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> cz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> py</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // cx,cy,cz 是节点中心，px,py,pz 是点坐标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((px </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cx) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">           ((py </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cy) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">           ((pz </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cz) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"跨节点对象-经典问题与解决方案\">跨节点对象：经典问题与解决方案</h2><p>四叉树/八叉树最棘手的问题是：<strong>当一个对象跨越多个子节点的边界时，应该放在哪里？</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[大对象横跨四个象限] --&gt; B{处理策略}&#10;    B --&gt; C[方案1: 放在最低公共祖先\\n保证包含对象的最高层节点]&#10;    B --&gt; D[方案2: 复制到所有相交节点\\n多份引用,查询时去重]&#10;    B --&gt; E[方案3: 松散八叉树\\n节点边界膨胀,对象进入单一节点]\">graph LR\n    A[大对象横跨四个象限] --&gt; B{处理策略}\n    B --&gt; C[方案1: 放在最低公共祖先\\n保证包含对象的最高层节点]\n    B --&gt; D[方案2: 复制到所有相交节点\\n多份引用,查询时去重]\n    B --&gt; E[方案3: 松散八叉树\\n节点边界膨胀,对象进入单一节点]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最低公共祖先</td>\n<td>每个对象只存一份</td>\n<td>大对象聚集在根节点，退化为线性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多节点复制</td>\n<td>查询简单</td>\n<td>内存占用增加，需要去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>松散八叉树</td>\n<td>每对象仍只存一份，查询高效</td>\n<td>实现复杂（详见第 4 章）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"四叉树-八叉树的查询\">四叉树/八叉树的查询</h2><h3 id=\"范围查询-矩形-aabb-查询\">范围查询（矩形/AABB 查询）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"void rangeQuery(QuadtreeNode* node, const AABB&amp; query,&#10;                std::vector&lt;int&gt;&amp; results) {&#10;    // 如果查询区域与节点区域不相交，剪枝&#10;    if (!node-&gt;bounds.intersects(query)) return;&#10;&#10;    if (node-&gt;isLeaf) {&#10;        // 叶节点：将所有对象加入候选&#10;        for (int id : node-&gt;objects) {&#10;            results.push_back(id);&#10;        }&#10;    } else {&#10;        // 内部节点：递归查询所有子节点&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; 4; i++) {&#10;            if (node-&gt;children[i]) {&#10;                rangeQuery(node-&gt;children[i], query, results);&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rangeQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QuadtreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AABB</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 如果查询区域与节点区域不相交，剪枝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node->bounds.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">intersects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node->isLeaf) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 叶节点：将所有对象加入候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id : node->objects) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push_back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 内部节点：递归查询所有子节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node->children[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                rangeQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node->children[i], query, results);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"点查询-给定点找包含它的所有对象\">点查询（给定点找包含它的所有对象）</h3><p>点查询可以利用空间局部性：从根节点向下，每层只需访问<strong>包含该点的子节点</strong>，时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（树深度）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"动态更新-插入与删除\">动态更新：插入与删除</h2><h3 id=\"对象移动时的更新\">对象移动时的更新</h3><p>游戏中对象持续移动，需要频繁更新树结构：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>检查是否仍在当前节点范围内</strong>：若否，删除并重新插入</li>\n<li><strong>自底向上传播包围盒更新</strong>：修改后的叶节点将新 AABB 传播给所有祖先节点</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant O as 移动对象&#10;    participant L as 当前叶节点&#10;    participant P as 父节点&#10;    participant R as 根节点&#10;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;L: 通知位置更新&#10;    L-&gt;&gt;L: 检查新位置是否在节点范围内&#10;    alt 仍在范围内&#10;        L-&gt;&gt;L: 更新对象位置记录&#10;    else 超出范围&#10;        L-&gt;&gt;L: 从当前节点删除&#10;        L-&gt;&gt;P: 通知删除&#10;        P-&gt;&gt;R: 考虑节点合并(若对象数少于阈值/2)&#10;        R-&gt;&gt;R: 从根节点重新插入对象&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant O as 移动对象\n    participant L as 当前叶节点\n    participant P as 父节点\n    participant R as 根节点\n\n    O-&gt;&gt;L: 通知位置更新\n    L-&gt;&gt;L: 检查新位置是否在节点范围内\n    alt 仍在范围内\n        L-&gt;&gt;L: 更新对象位置记录\n    else 超出范围\n        L-&gt;&gt;L: 从当前节点删除\n        L-&gt;&gt;P: 通知删除\n        P-&gt;&gt;R: 考虑节点合并(若对象数少于阈值/2)\n        R-&gt;&gt;R: 从根节点重新插入对象\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"节点合并\">节点合并</h3><p>当节点中对象数量降低到阈值以下时，可以进行<strong>合并（collapse）</strong>：将一个内部节点的所有子节点合并，转变为叶节点。合并阈值通常设为分裂阈值的一半（避免频繁的分裂-合并抖动）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"深度限制与内存控制\">深度限制与内存控制</h2><p>无限递归分裂会导致内存爆炸。实践中需要两个限制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>最大深度</strong>：通常设为 6-10 层，超过后强制停止分裂，叶节点可以存储更多对象</li>\n<li><strong>最小节点尺寸</strong>：当节点的物理尺寸小于某阈值时停止分裂</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对于 3D 场景，八叉树的内存上限：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>最大节点数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{最大节点数} = \\frac{8^{d+1} - 1}{7} \\approx O(8^d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">最大节点数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2121em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 时约有 1900 万节点——因此实际应用中深度通常控制在 5-7 层。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能特性分析\">性能特性分析</h2><h3 id=\"时间复杂度\">时间复杂度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>均匀分布</th>\n<th>非均匀分布（聚集）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>插入</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>点查询</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围查询（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个结果）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k + \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k + \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"与空间哈希的对比\">与空间哈希的对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>四叉树/八叉树</th>\n<th>空间哈希</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>非均匀分布</td>\n<td>优秀（自适应细分）</td>\n<td>差（固定网格）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询最坏情况</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 有保证</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（哈希冲突严重时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层次化查询（LOD）</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n<td>需额外层级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存预测性</td>\n<td>难以预测</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"游戏引擎中的实际应用\">游戏引擎中的实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"场景管理\">场景管理</h3><p>Unreal Engine 的 World Partition 系统使用类八叉树结构进行大世界的场景流送管理，根节点对应整个关卡，叶节点对应可以独立加载/卸载的流送单元。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lod-系统集成\">LOD 系统集成</h3><p>八叉树的层次结构天然适合 LOD（Level of Detail）管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"深度 0（根）：整个场景，LOD 4（最低细节）&#10;深度 1：大区域，LOD 3&#10;深度 2：中等区域，LOD 2&#10;深度 3：小区域，LOD 1&#10;深度 4+（叶）：近距离，LOD 0（最高细节）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>深度 0（根）：整个场景，LOD 4（最低细节）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>深度 1：大区域，LOD 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>深度 2：中等区域，LOD 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>深度 3：小区域，LOD 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>深度 4+（叶）：近距离，LOD 0（最高细节）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>摄像机与节点的距离决定使用哪个层级的 LOD，不需要对每个对象单独计算距离。</p>\n<h3 id=\"视锥剔除加速\">视锥剔除加速</h3><p>四叉树/八叉树可以高效支持视锥剔除：对于一个内部节点，若其边界与视锥完全不相交，则剪枝整个子树；若完全在视锥内，则所有子节点都可见，不需要继续细化测试。这与第 3 章视锥剔除中的层次遍历思路相同，参见 <a href=\"../query-culling/frustum-culling\">视锥剔除</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"松散八叉树简介\">松散八叉树简介</h2><p>标准八叉树对大对象处理不佳，<strong>松散八叉树（Loose Octree）</strong> 将每个节点的边界向外膨胀 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 倍（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，即边长翻倍），使得每个对象只需存入一个节点，彻底消除跨节点问题。具体实现与分析见 <a href=\"../advanced-techniques/loose-octree-lod\">松散八叉树与 LOD</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>四叉树和八叉树通过递归细分实现自适应空间划分：稠密区域精细划分，稀疏区域粗粒度节省内存。核心工程要点：分裂阈值控制树的深度与宽度平衡；大对象跨节点问题用最低公共祖先或松散变体解决；节点合并阈值设为分裂阈值一半避免抖动；深度限制防止内存爆炸。与空间哈希相比，四叉树/八叉树在非均匀分布场景有显著优势，且天然支持层次化 LOD 和视锥剔除加速。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"四叉树与八叉树：自适应空间细分","id":"四叉树与八叉树-自适应空间细分"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四叉树：2D 场景的自适应划分","id":"四叉树-2d-场景的自适应划分"},{"level":3,"text":"基本结构","id":"基本结构"},{"level":3,"text":"节点实现","id":"节点实现"},{"level":2,"text":"八叉树：3D 空间的自然延伸","id":"八叉树-3d-空间的自然延伸"},{"level":3,"text":"子节点索引编码","id":"子节点索引编码"},{"level":2,"text":"跨节点对象：经典问题与解决方案","id":"跨节点对象-经典问题与解决方案"},{"level":2,"text":"四叉树/八叉树的查询","id":"四叉树-八叉树的查询"},{"level":3,"text":"范围查询（矩形/AABB 查询）","id":"范围查询-矩形-aabb-查询"},{"level":3,"text":"点查询（给定点找包含它的所有对象）","id":"点查询-给定点找包含它的所有对象"},{"level":2,"text":"动态更新：插入与删除","id":"动态更新-插入与删除"},{"level":3,"text":"对象移动时的更新","id":"对象移动时的更新"},{"level":3,"text":"节点合并","id":"节点合并"},{"level":2,"text":"深度限制与内存控制","id":"深度限制与内存控制"},{"level":2,"text":"性能特性分析","id":"性能特性分析"},{"level":3,"text":"时间复杂度","id":"时间复杂度"},{"level":3,"text":"与空间哈希的对比","id":"与空间哈希的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"游戏引擎中的实际应用","id":"游戏引擎中的实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"场景管理","id":"场景管理"},{"level":3,"text":"LOD 系统集成","id":"lod-系统集成"},{"level":3,"text":"视锥剔除加速","id":"视锥剔除加速"},{"level":2,"text":"松散八叉树简介","id":"松散八叉树简介"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"空间哈希与均匀网格：游戏中的 $O(1)$ 空间查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/spatial-hashing"},"next":{"title":"BSP 树与空间二分：游戏历史中最重要的空间结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/foundations/bsp-trees"}}